<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops are now conducting airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, while Haitian police raids in Port-au-Prince have eliminated suspected gang members. A market near the capital was attacked, leaving ten dead and seven injured. The UN chief condemned an attack that killed 47 civilians and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. Bukele disclosed details on the deaths of El Salvador’s troops in Haiti. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQU3RheHgwdFB4cXN6cDk0SEdPZzdwOUtwV212a29zdWdycDd4YkxETUI1ZTNpdFRkeElsRGNmRGZvcHh2N285LTRMSVFkbmVJRmtsaVpkR2ZLT3NzU0xObW9qYmlHYmwyOTYyLU42MUlpSkJkT1Bwb3dUSlR3OGY5U1BKQ2FrSmFmcHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPZnRnanpKR0hRWHBWU3pGMVI5bU1GV0IyYU1Fb3dZWDZ4eXdzWG1qYTEtN192a0ZVRFJFalFlLVlOZGVXTXBjY1BBMkx6Z3lNQ2VRSXpkWW5WdENoeGVWZUk3T1F6ck03bUpyczB3NFVzaVpSd3RiSFRiWWRfcUJ6alFja2M4WXota1JNMTNnbURpSmVIYmRvVmp5bkU5OGdtTzNMRHE3cXlnUVRCYy1vb1NnQ3JkbVJ4T2NXa3VlU2trdFZHWXNfb0xBeHhaUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNYjBiT1NpVkpPUzdadU1ObnZhanRnbWlNbUNpT2lvLXIxYllRaExUUWNmREVtdjliTERjdUt6dlB1OFZZT2pNdUxaaWNwTm1qdklGWXZaUkVJWTVLbnFndG9mR0JJSGpXZi15SzhuWVhPLVdXVDNvaEJra3FzanlMZ1Vad3V5V2IydjZIemVjSmJKWnBWUHVrNGpfUHp4RjNnNGVPZHE2VjJ5Q2pQWUdJUkluT01nbkg5NEJ3WjAzLXo?oc=5&quot;&gt;LatinAmerican Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPVkNUdTBnWURkWnZ3TUN6cl9fNi1RamM1MFRDNFdkUUFxcVVBTHVYVWFEdkh1V1FjWlZ4cjVMeVVlVXEyYVBDNC13Tzd5ZnZnb3A1bzQ5ZXRldU1LSjI5Q2x